---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Personal background, experience, and project portfolio"
	pubDate={new Date('September 01 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hello! I'm a software engineer passionate about building scalable web applications, developer tooling,
		and modern user experiences.
	</p>

	<h2>What I Do</h2>
	<p>
		I specialize in building full-stack applications with modern frameworks like Astro, TypeScript, React, and Node.js.
		I love crafting fast, accessible, and responsive software solutions.
	</p>

	<h2>My Projects</h2>
	<p>
		On this website, you'll find both:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Personal Projects:</strong> Open-source tools, experiments, and creative side projects.</li>
		<li><strong>Previous Work:</strong> Key highlights, case studies, and engineering achievements from past roles and client projects.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Get In Touch</h2>
	<p>
		Feel free to explore my <a href="/projects">projects</a>, check out my <a href="/blog">blog posts</a>,
		or connect with me on <a href="https://github.com/maghamis" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
